<title>USA: Katz Digital Q3 share declines.</title>
<headline>Katz Digital Q3 share declines.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended Sept. 30,</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p>     Net sales			 $  3,906,584    $  2,534,383</p>
<p>     Net earnings			    79,868	   449,655</p>
<p> (b) Pro forma net earnings		79,868	   255,554</p>
<p>     Pro forma net earnings per share     .02		 .09</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>outstanding:</p>
<p>		Primary		     4,477,211	 2,954,443</p>
<p>					   Nine Months Ended Sept. 30,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
