<p>     Pro forma net earnings per share     .14		 .26</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>outstanding:</p>
<p>	   Primary			  3,986,336	 2,954,443</p>
<p>(a)  Net loss for the nine months 1996 reflects a non-recurring charge of $723,000 relating to the termination of Subchapter S status on March 25, 1996. (b)  Pro forma net earnings reflect a provision for additional Federal and State taxes that the company was not previously subject to, and for the nine months ended Sept. 30, 1996 also excludes the $723,000 nonrecurring charge relating to the termination of Subchapter S status.</p>
